{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"sans-serif\", \"microsoft jhenghei\";'>18:30</span>]</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">特別天氣提示︰位於廣東的一道冷鋒正向南移動，與其相關的驟雨及雷暴會在未來兩三小時影響珠江口一帶，部分地區雨勢較大。市民請留意天氣變化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T11:18:40.065320+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}